From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] evr: A format check while streaming keeps the presenter's services (6548)

The EVR filter brought its services up for every QueryAccept on its input
pin (InitServicePointers on the mixer and the presenter) and released them
after the check. A decoder asks QueryAccept while streaming before a
dynamic format change -- LAV Video does with 4:4:4 H.264, which it sends as
RGB32 -- and the release reached a running presenter: MPC-HC's presenter
stops its worker threads in ReleaseServicePointers, never asked the mixer
for output again, and the picture stayed black (sound played).

Services that are up stay up: a check brings them up and releases them
only when they were not.
---
diff --git a/dlls/evr/evr.c b/dlls/evr/evr.c
index 4fa5601..813a213 100644
--- a/dlls/evr/evr.c
+++ b/dlls/evr/evr.c
@@ -293,7 +293,14 @@ static HRESULT evr_test_input_type(struct evr *filter, const AM_MEDIA_TYPE *mt,
     if (!filter->presenter)
         hr = evr_initialize(filter, NULL, NULL);
 
+    /* Stained Glass OS: services that are up stay up -- a format check while
+     * streaming (QueryAccept of a dynamic format change) does not initialize
+     * them again */
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_EVR_QUERYACCEPT_RELEASES
+    if (SUCCEEDED(hr) && !(filter->flags & EVR_PRESENTER_INITED_SERVICES))
+#else
     if (SUCCEEDED(hr))
+#endif
         hr = evr_init_services(filter);
 
     if (SUCCEEDED(hr))
@@ -501,11 +508,21 @@ static HRESULT evr_query_accept(struct strmbase_renderer *iface, const AM_MEDIA_
 {
     struct evr *filter = impl_from_strmbase_renderer(iface);
     HRESULT hr;
+    BOOL inited;
 
     EnterCriticalSection(&filter->renderer.filter.filter_cs);
 
+    /* Stained Glass OS: the services are released only if this check brought
+     * them up. Asked while streaming (a decoder's QueryAccept for a dynamic
+     * format change: LAV with 4:4:4 video), releasing them released the
+     * presenter's service pointers: MPC-HC's presenter stopped its threads and
+     * the picture stayed black. */
+    inited = !!(filter->flags & EVR_PRESENTER_INITED_SERVICES);
     hr = evr_test_input_type(filter, mt, NULL);
-    evr_release_services(filter);
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_EVR_QUERYACCEPT_RELEASES
+    if (!inited)
+#endif
+        evr_release_services(filter);
 
     LeaveCriticalSection(&filter->renderer.filter.filter_cs);
 
